+# Proposed native Gomoku S1 acceptance gate
+
+> Evidence-only proposal; not applied to product source or `main`.
+
+- Replay every submitted shard with an independent rules checker.
+- Count preset opening stones separately from real Bot decisions.
+- Require exact and symmetry-normalised diversity statistics.
+- Keep incomplete, invalid or duplicate-on-resume records out of completed counts.
+- Test a formation candidate with colour-swapped held-out openings.
+- Require the 95% lower score bound to exceed 50% before default promotion.
+- Retain forced win / forced block precedence over any learned or formation score.
+- Import only verified, bounded, additive data; never overwrite a player archive.
